-- =============================================================================
-- FILE: 14_test_journals.sql
-- =============================================================================
-- =============================================================================
-- Seed: 14_test_journals.sql
-- Deterministic journal fixture for row-scope, role-swap and hand-off tests.
--
-- Three groups, no journal shared between them:
--
--   TJ-A*  testuser1 prepares, testuser2 approves
--   TJ-S*  the SAME two people with the seats REVERSED —
--          testuser2 prepares, testuser1 approves
--   TJ-B*  testuser3 prepares, testuser4 approves (single-role control)
--
-- TJ-S* is the important one. Without a role-swapped pair, "scoped by user" and
-- "scoped by (user, active role)" produce identical results and the distinction
-- cannot be tested. With it:
--
--   testuser1 acting as PREPARER → sees TJ-A*, must NOT see TJ-S*
--   testuser1 acting as APPROVER → sees TJ-S*, must NOT see TJ-A*
--
-- Statuses cover every gate: a journal awaiting the preparer, one handed off to
-- the approver (so the preparer must be read-only), and a terminal one.
--
--   TJ-A1  NOT_PREPARED   testuser1's to-do (prepare)
--   TJ-A2  PREPARED       handed off — read-only for testuser1, to-do for testuser2
--   TJ-A3  APPROVED       terminal — read-only for both assignees
--   TJ-S1  NOT_PREPARED   testuser2's to-do (prepare); testuser1 approves later
--   TJ-S2  PREPARED       testuser1's to-do (approve)
